      "text": "A small image of the cover of 'Digital Documentation of COVID-19 Certificates: Vaccination Status - Technical specifications and implementation guidance': a dark blue cover with an illustration of a circuit board joining vaccine vials, a syringe, a virus particle, a phone and a laptop, and the WHO logo. In Figure 1 it illustrates the DDCC: Vaccination Status guidance.",
